window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Few authors have achieved such renown as World Fantasy Life Achievement honoree and Science Fiction Writers of America Grand Master Andre Norton. With the love of fans and the praise of critics, Norton's books have sold millions of copies worldwide.</b></p> <p>Far away in space and time, the Witch World has become the legendary home of all who dream and wonder of unknown worlds.</p> <p><i>Lore of the Witch World</i> brings together in one volume all the novelettes and tales of the Witch World, including the never previously published novelette <i>Changeling</i>.</p>"; 
